# Create React App: when "proxy" is set in package.json, the dev server only allows the
# local hostname it detected. Tunneling tools (ngrok, LocalTunnel, etc.) send another Host header
# → "Invalid Host header". Uncomment to allow external hostnames during local dev only:

DANGEROUSLY_DISABLE_HOST_CHECK=true

# If hot reload websocket fails through ngrok, also set these to your tunnel (no scheme):
# WDS_SOCKET_HOST=your-name.ngrok-free.app
# WDS_SOCKET_PORT=443
